 artisti, collezionisti, proprietari di gallerie d'arte, imprenditori. Al centro della storia c'è il famoso dipinto Broadway Boogie-Woogie di Piet Mondrian, cui tutti sono interessati e da cui si sviluppano le varie storie. Con qualsiasi mezzo in loro possesso tutti sono pronti a tradire il prossimo pur di ottenere fama, denaro e sesso."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In London's contemporary art world, everyone has a hustle. Art Spindle runs a high-end gallery: he hopes to flip a Mondrian for millions. One of his assistants, Beth, is sleeping with Art's most acquisitive client, Bob Macclestone. Beth wants Bob to set her up in her own gallery, so she helps him go behind Art's back for the Mondrian. Bob's wife, Jean, sets her eye on a young conceptual artist, Jo, who lusts after Art's newest assistant, Paige. Meanwhile, self-absorbed videographer Elaine is chewing her way through friends and lovers looking to make it: if she'll throw Dewey, her agent, under the bus, Beth may give her a show. And the Mondrian? No honor among thieves.","tagline":"Seduction. Betrayal. Death. There's an Art to Everything."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k17a0yd4vYh2L8yHKlLBghYf5Bv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8L159knc8X0JnV5wdSGDpuhlemx.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":36939,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k17a0yd4vYh2L8yHKlLBghYf5Bv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k17a0yd4vYh2L8yHKlLBghYf5Bv.jpg","language":"it","width":523,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k17a0yd4vYh2L8yHKlLBghYf5Bv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k17a0yd4vYh2L8yHKlLBghYf5Bv.jpg","language":"it","width":523,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"availab